<title>BRAZIL: BRAZIL ORANGE JUICE INDUSTRY REPORTS WEEKLY OUTPUT.</title>
<headline>BRAZIL ORANGE JUICE INDUSTRY REPORTS WEEKLY OUTPUT.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for the week July 28-August 3 and the total for 1997/98.</p>
<p>	  July 28-Aug 3   July 29-Aug 4    TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		     1997/98     1996/97    1997/98	1996/97</p>
<p> Stocks/open    282,818.5   243,742.9</p>
<p> Production	47,075.2    42,745.4   272,340.3    180,277.8</p>
<p> Shipment	  28,877.7    26,472.4   93,995.1     89,107.7</p>
<p> Home Market	  246.4	 273.8    1,487.7	1,368.6</p>
<p> Stocks/close   300,769.6   259,742.1</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
</text>
